(1930224, 266035, 47487, '<td valign="top">good: repetition of blues.<br/>ehh: flash shadows, wrapping-paper background (but good thinking in a pinch, really, on that).<br/>All in all this seems like something you put together really quickly. Don''t know if it was or not.</td>', 'good: repetition of blues.ehh: flash shadows, wrapping-paper background (but good thinking in a pinch, really, on that).All in all this seems like something you put together really quickly. Don''t know if it was or not.', '2005-12-07 02:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
