(1930484, 266104, 37015, '<td valign="top">I think that bringing the background slightly more into focus would have made the image more interesting.  Although, it is nicely composed, the grapes are in front of a haze and this makes them "less real" and almost unnatural.</td>', 'I think that bringing the background slightly more into focus would have made the image more interesting.  Although, it is nicely composed, the grapes are in front of a haze and this makes them "less real" and almost unnatural.', '2005-12-07 04:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
