(1931054, 265719, 46031, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea of the picture. The b&amp;w adds to its effect, in my opinion, as the colors of the cell phone display might have been a little distracting. The blurred hand also adds nicely to the "just a second too late" character of the picture.<br/>One thing I don''t like is the backgtround, it just doesn''t have enough contrast with the hand and the phone; on the right side, you can''t really tell where the phone ends and the background begins. This might also be due to the lighting which makes the phone cast a distinct shadow. <br/>I also find it distracting a little distracting how the light produces a lot of glare on the phone.<br/>Don''t get me wrong though, I really like this picture!</td>', 'I really like the idea of the picture. The b&w adds to its effect, in my opinion, as the colors of the cell phone display might have been a little distracting. The blurred hand also adds nicely to the "just a second too late" character of the picture.One thing I don''t like is the backgtround, it just doesn''t have enough contrast with the hand and the phone; on the right side, you can''t really tell where the phone ends and the background begins. This might also be due to the lighting which makes the phone cast a distinct shadow. I also find it distracting a little distracting how the light produces a lot of glare on the phone.Don''t get me wrong though, I really like this picture!', '2005-12-07 08:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
