(1933832, 264003, 37015, '<td valign="top">I like the warm colors in this photo; very serene almost in spite of the subject matter.  Great composition as well.</td>', 'I like the warm colors in this photo; very serene almost in spite of the subject matter.  Great composition as well.', '2005-12-07 21:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933848, 265010, 37015, '<td valign="top">Although I do understand what you''re trying to say, I feel that everything is too blurry in this photo and the people/person are well on their way to their destination.  Because of this, I think it''s mistitled - it should be "Way too late" as opposed to "Just missed it".</td>', 'Although I do understand what you''re trying to say, I feel that everything is too blurry in this photo and the people/person are well on their way to their destination.  Because of this, I think it''s mistitled - it should be "Way too late" as opposed to "Just missed it".', '2005-12-07 21:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933858, 265598, 37015, '<td valign="top">Great sense of momentum in this picture even though, like you said, it''s passed the "main event".</td>', 'Great sense of momentum in this picture even though, like you said, it''s passed the "main event".', '2005-12-07 21:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933875, 265780, 37015, '<td valign="top">This image is a bit plain to me; nothing stands out.  Perhaps taking a shot of a single piece of cake among the remains of the entire cake and entitling it "Still one piece left" or something to that effect would have been a bit more interesting.</td>', 'This image is a bit plain to me; nothing stands out.  Perhaps taking a shot of a single piece of cake among the remains of the entire cake and entitling it "Still one piece left" or something to that effect would have been a bit more interesting.', '2005-12-07 22:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933885, 263937, 37015, '<td valign="top">This photo hould be a bit sharper and I can''t quite find what''s "too late" about this image.</td>', 'This photo hould be a bit sharper and I can''t quite find what''s "too late" about this image.', '2005-12-07 22:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933889, 265700, 37015, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.  The solitude is great.  The slight flaring of the lamp make the image for me.</td>', 'I love this photo.  The solitude is great.  The slight flaring of the lamp make the image for me.', '2005-12-07 22:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933916, 264817, 37015, '<td valign="top">It''s odd, but I think being able to make out some of the details on the stairs and the slide hurt this photo slightly.  At about the level of the bottom of the "gazebo" upwards this image is beautiful.  However, I think making the lower half of the image darker (I guess, the entire image darker due to the Basic Editing Rules) would have helped.  I still like this picture though. ;)</td>', 'It''s odd, but I think being able to make out some of the details on the stairs and the slide hurt this photo slightly.  At about the level of the bottom of the "gazebo" upwards this image is beautiful.  However, I think making the lower half of the image darker (I guess, the entire image darker due to the Basic Editing Rules) would have helped.  I still like this picture though. ;)', '2005-12-07 22:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1933945, 266110, 40885, '<td valign="top">where''s the bullet hole?<br/>kidding, i like it alot.</td>', 'where''s the bullet hole?kidding, i like it alot.', '2005-12-07 22:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
