(1936756, 264539, 46806, '<td valign="top">Clever!  This is one of the first things that popped into my mind when thinking of ideas for the "two late" theme.  The lighting is good, how the backround light is centered behind the baby.  I think the model''s shape is a little weird though, but i don''t know how that can be corrected.  On my monitor the skin tone of the left arm has a unattractive green cast when contrasted with the rose background.  I''d like it better if the watch was gone and the exposure was lower so that the arm would be lost in the silhouette. 8</td>', 'Clever!  This is one of the first things that popped into my mind when thinking of ideas for the "two late" theme.  The lighting is good, how the backround light is centered behind the baby.  I think the model''s shape is a little weird though, but i don''t know how that can be corrected.  On my monitor the skin tone of the left arm has a unattractive green cast when contrasted with the rose background.  I''d like it better if the watch was gone and the exposure was lower so that the arm would be lost in the silhouette. 8', '2005-12-08 22:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
