(1936793, 264522, 46806, '<td valign="top">This could have been framed better and focused better.  Also I don''t get any sense of time when looking at this.  Maybe if everything was in sharp focus and the train was blurred due to motion the picture would be stronger.  But even then, the silver train against the gray sky is not captivating.  It would have been better if taken at night, so that the train could be blurred easier with a long exposure and that the silver could stand out against the black background. Now it''s a 2.</td>', 'This could have been framed better and focused better.  Also I don''t get any sense of time when looking at this.  Maybe if everything was in sharp focus and the train was blurred due to motion the picture would be stronger.  But even then, the silver train against the gray sky is not captivating.  It would have been better if taken at night, so that the train could be blurred easier with a long exposure and that the silver could stand out against the black background. Now it''s a 2.', '2005-12-08 23:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
