(1937531, 266155, 48224, '<td valign="top">I like the concept.The composition isn''t too bad, though it does seem slightly unbalanced. Probably would have benefited from the egg being turned forward a little more so the leg wasn''t sticking so far out to the side and causing the empty space to the bottom and top of it. Also I don''t really care for the color in this image...just looks like bad white balance...</td>', 'I like the concept.The composition isn''t too bad, though it does seem slightly unbalanced. Probably would have benefited from the egg being turned forward a little more so the leg wasn''t sticking so far out to the side and causing the empty space to the bottom and top of it. Also I don''t really care for the color in this image...just looks like bad white balance...', '2005-12-09 09:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
