(1941084, 266097, 8891, '<td valign="top">Just the slightest bit of movement in the right hand, otherwise this is fantastic. Love the tone you choose...like a midnight blue or shot in moonlight....it''s a fine touch. Great motion of the rolling pin.  Suspect this is the Daniel. But I have been known to be wrong.</td>', 'Just the slightest bit of movement in the right hand, otherwise this is fantastic. Love the tone you choose...like a midnight blue or shot in moonlight....it''s a fine touch. Great motion of the rolling pin.  Suspect this is the Daniel. But I have been known to be wrong.', '2005-12-10 21:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1941097, 264827, 8891, '<td valign="top">The focus is a bit soft in this. I''m having trouble deciding if the dark on and around the face is a furry pillow or hair. Not sure.</td>', 'The focus is a bit soft in this. I''m having trouble deciding if the dark on and around the face is a furry pillow or hair. Not sure.', '2005-12-10 21:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1941099, 264699, 41800, '<td valign="top">creative idea but unfortunately due to the overcast weather you have a dark, unsharp image with a bright blob over your subject. Perhaps you might of used the rule of thirds and included the rest of the warning sign since most people will be attracted to the writing first. we all like to read.</td>', 'creative idea but unfortunately due to the overcast weather you have a dark, unsharp image with a bright blob over your subject. Perhaps you might of used the rule of thirds and included the rest of the warning sign since most people will be attracted to the writing first. we all like to read.', '2005-12-10 21:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1941101, 266096, 8891, '<td valign="top">mazeltov!</td>', 'mazeltov!', '2005-12-10 21:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1941106, 265846, 41800, '<td valign="top">I would change the crop if possible so the eye is at the rule of thirds intersection otherwise great capture, good use of lighting</td>', 'I would change the crop if possible so the eye is at the rule of thirds intersection otherwise great capture, good use of lighting', '2005-12-10 21:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1941116, 263937, 41800, '<td valign="top">Not very sharp</td>', 'Not very sharp', '2005-12-10 21:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1941125, 264693, 41800, '<td valign="top">Great effort here. your carving talents are matched by your photographic talents</td>', 'Great effort here. your carving talents are matched by your photographic talents', '2005-12-10 21:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1941174, 266086, 47096, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. Good interpretation of theme.</td>', 'Nice lighting. Good interpretation of theme.', '2005-12-10 22:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1941176, 265622, 47096, '<td valign="top">Good illustration of "too late!" Is it my imagination, or is that cat smirking?</td>', 'Good illustration of "too late!" Is it my imagination, or is that cat smirking?', '2005-12-10 22:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1941200, 265302, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - One of the very few who actually ''Met the Challenge'' (my interpretation at least), well done, it was not easy.  Criticism; difficult given the nature of the Challenge.. perhaps some more space on the right, who knows.  Up to 7 from 6 (the child''s face also ''shows'' ''too late'' so well done).</td>', '7 - One of the very few who actually ''Met the Challenge'' (my interpretation at least), well done, it was not easy.  Criticism; difficult given the nature of the Challenge.. perhaps some more space on the right, who knows.  Up to 7 from 6 (the child''s face also ''shows'' ''too late'' so well done).', '2005-12-10 22:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1941204, 265870, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - One of the few who ''Met the Challenge'' (my interpretation at least) quite well, it was not easy.  Criticism; difficult given the nature of the Challenge, but perhaps a tighter crop at the top would have made this even better.  Like your title.</td>', '7 - One of the few who ''Met the Challenge'' (my interpretation at least) quite well, it was not easy.  Criticism; difficult given the nature of the Challenge, but perhaps a tighter crop at the top would have made this even better.  Like your title.', '2005-12-10 22:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1941207, 264817, 41800, '<td valign="top">back lighting does not work for this shot. too dark to see the subject clearly and too light for a sillouette</td>', 'back lighting does not work for this shot. too dark to see the subject clearly and too light for a sillouette', '2005-12-10 22:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1941210, 264602, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - One of the very few who actually ''Met the Challenge'' (my interpretation at least), well done, it was not easy.  Criticism; difficult to comment (and indeed vote) given the nature of the Challenge .. especially on this one.  I like the use of space though, perhaps slightly less ''height'' may have worked even better, not sure.</td>', '6 - One of the very few who actually ''Met the Challenge'' (my interpretation at least), well done, it was not easy.  Criticism; difficult to comment (and indeed vote) given the nature of the Challenge .. especially on this one.  I like the use of space though, perhaps slightly less ''height'' may have worked even better, not sure.', '2005-12-10 22:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1941219, 265588, 32893, '<td valign="top">Can''t wait to hear about this photo....<br/> <br/>It would be nice if you could show a little motion on the helicopter blades and still stop the car but, admittedly, that would be tough.<br/> <br/>Nice shot.</td>', 'Can''t wait to hear about this photo.... It would be nice if you could show a little motion on the helicopter blades and still stop the car but, admittedly, that would be tough. Nice shot.', '2005-12-10 22:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1941221, 265856, 32893, '<td valign="top">I realize that this is a fisheye but a little angle to the right might be good....thinking out loud.<br/> <br/>Nice color.  I like the mix of texture.</td>', 'I realize that this is a fisheye but a little angle to the right might be good....thinking out loud. Nice color.  I like the mix of texture.', '2005-12-10 22:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1941285, 265039, 37252, '<td valign="top">Very powerful image. The emotion really flows from this.<br/>I love the composition, the low angle, and the sunset. Everything comes together beautifully here.<br/> My pick for the blue<br/></td>', 'Very powerful image. The emotion really flows from this.I love the composition, the low angle, and the sunset. Everything comes together beautifully here. My pick for the blue', '2005-12-10 23:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
