(1941929, 266141, 5885, '<td valign="top">Your pooooor model ... lol... and I thought I tortured mine. .. I like it good idea and good color and exposure. <br/> <br/>Composition has a little to work on.  Where''s her feet? Make sure you don''t cut off any limps in cropping. This is the single easiest way to ruin a composition. Also, move her a little to the left in the frame, that would provide more interest in the subject and help to contrast her against the snow (rule of thirds)....</td>', 'Your pooooor model ... lol... and I thought I tortured mine. .. I like it good idea and good color and exposure.  Composition has a little to work on.  Where''s her feet? Make sure you don''t cut off any limps in cropping. This is the single easiest way to ruin a composition. Also, move her a little to the left in the frame, that would provide more interest in the subject and help to contrast her against the snow (rule of thirds)....', '2005-12-11 11:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
