(1946570, 264548, 18207, '<td valign="top">(This is the third time I make this comment, I can only hope it will stay this time.)<br/>So, it''s amazing. A like when PP is based on the general or on a specific feeling on the shot instead of being based on some predefined rules. In this case the feeling grabs me, it holds my breath.<br/>Excellent work, congratulations! Gave 9 for the first two times because I''d rather like the focus on the left eye instead of the nose (those votes disappeared as well as the comments), but now I give it 10. What else could I do to express I like this photo so much? :-)</td>', '(This is the third time I make this comment, I can only hope it will stay this time.)So, it''s amazing. A like when PP is based on the general or on a specific feeling on the shot instead of being based on some predefined rules. In this case the feeling grabs me, it holds my breath.Excellent work, congratulations! Gave 9 for the first two times because I''d rather like the focus on the left eye instead of the nose (those votes disappeared as well as the comments), but now I give it 10. What else could I do to express I like this photo so much? :-)', '2005-12-13 07:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
